Janaka sends horsemen to fetch brother Kuśadhvaja from Sāṃkāśyā --- Kuśadhvaja arrives and greets Janaka and Śatānanda --- Brothers dispatch Sudāman to bring Daśaratha with sons and counselors --- Sudāman bows and delivers Janaka invitation to Daśaratha --- Daśaratha approaches Janaka with kinsmen sages and priests --- Daśaratha names Vasiṣṭha as speaker for Ikṣvāku house --- Vasiṣṭha recites Solar lineage from Brahmā to Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa --- Vasiṣṭha asks Janaka daughters for Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa